{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Pilot a four-day school week in England",
        "additional_details": "This isn't about having a day off school. It's about organising the school week differently so pupils have time for independent learning and wellbeing while still having access to school.",
        "background": "I am calling for the Government to permit and independently evaluate four-day school-week trials, while maintaining educational standards and protecting pupils who need additional school-based support.",
